<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<article xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <body>
    <p>This wholly synthetic toy relates y to a and x in <m:math id="eq1" alttext="y = a * x"><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</p>
    <p>It separately relates z to b and x in <m:math id="eq2" alttext="z = b / x"><m:mrow><m:mi>z</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>.</p>
  </body>
</article>
